      "value": "@{5b28d7576ec5d16bbac6c445|full_name}: definitely second this. I have excellent internet but every now and then my ping will shoot from mid 30s to ~300 for about 20 seconds. This usually sends me a bit of lag, and then reloads me into either a different instance, or Login loop. This filter really sucks as it can happen while friends and I are world jumping or mid conversation. It makes VRChat a difficult place to hang out when we could just Discord call and if everyone Discord calls to hang out, nobody is on VRChat",
