      "value": "@{5a9de1adf3791b4155afcc03|full_name}: I fully agree. I only have excellent internet because I have so few bills to deal with and even with my occasional lag, I'm affected. As a creator of your magnitude, I can only imagine your frustration. I've seen so many people use avatars from your worlds all over VRChat so your contributions are at least somewhat significant to many users. You'd think they would focus on perhaps a warning system for ping levels rather than just auto booting people. Some people's work is much more important than others, ie yours to mine :P. I mainly get on to hang out with friends and see what new avatars are to offer. You're likely constantly updating and testing multiple worlds and Avatar ideas. Certainly not acceptable for this filter to throw out the lesser internet connections",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
