      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This problem has been going on for a month now and still hasn't been fixed. This is a major inconvenience to everyone wanting to play with friends and it is making people quit playing VRChat all together. New players will keep on giving this game hate UNLESS you fix it. Stop adding stuff that nobody wants and doesn't care about (The avatar menu that displays all the polys and dynamic bones on your model for example). Nobody cares about these things and they are completely useless. Some streamers are suffering from this issue and it gives your game such a bad name, due to new players wanting to see what the game is like and they just see loading loops left, right and center. Fix your game if you want people to continue playing it. Please and thank you.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
